      "translations": [
        {
          "language_code": "eng",
          "text": [
            "I shall know within my heart that Śrī Kṛṣṇa takes pleasure in Śrī Rādhā’s happiness, and so I shall never desire to abandon Her lotus feet and to enjoy separately with Śrī Kṛṣṇa."
          ]
        }
